OL,3,AEleven arrested as pro-Palestinian
OL,4,Amarches held in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven people were arrested as several
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian demonstrations were
OL,8,Fheld in London on Wednesday, the
OL,9,FMetropolitan Police has said.
OL,11,FAmong them were five people arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of inciting racial hatred at
OL,13,Fa protest outside the office of the
OL,14,FBoard of Deputies of British Jews in
OL,15,Fnorth London.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
