OL,3,AEleven arrested as pro-Palestinian
OL,4,Amarches held in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the other arrests were
OL,7,Fmade at student-led pro-Palestinian
OL,8,Fprotests elsewhere in the capital,
OL,9,Fwhich went ahead despite calls for them
OL,10,Fto be postponed so they did not fall on
OL,11,F7 October. One of those arrested was
OL,12,Fpart of a counter-protest.
OL,14,FWednesday marked three years since the
OL,15,F7 October attack on Israel by Hamas, in
OL,16,Fwhich around 1,200 people were killed
OL,17,Fand 251 others were taken as hostages
OL,18,Fby the militant group.
